# BlueOffice Breach - Challenge 4: SSH + Privilege Escalation
# Minimal hardened-ish sshd config: password auth enabled (intended,
# for the chakir login), direct root login disabled (root must be
# reached only via the intentional sudo misconfiguration).

Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes

X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog no

Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server

AllowUsers chakir
